  "about": "Phase 62 -- the till's bill arithmetic, shared by the server (InvoiceLine.CreatePos, Invoice.ApplyRoundOff; PosBillSharedCasesTests) and the till screen (pos-bill.ts; pos-bill.spec.ts). The till shows a total before the server has seen the sale, and the cashier takes money against it, so the two must agree to the paisa. Every line figure is rounded to the paisa half away from zero; the bill is rounded to the nearest rupee half away from zero when the location rounds.",
